BT /F1 10.000 Tf 0.0902 0.2314 0.1961 rg 1 0 0 1 48.000 202.300 Tm (describes separating Views/ViewModels from Repositories/Services; this project adopts that structure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.000 Tf 0.0902 0.2314 0.1961 rg 1 0 0 1 48.000 187.800 Tm (with a small game-rule component rather than a large framework hierarchy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.000 Tf 0.0902 0.2314 0.1961 rg 1 0 0 1 48.000 168.300 Tm (Use SQLite for atomic local session/progress/outbox changes and Supabase for anonymous Auth plus) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.000 Tf 0.0902 0.2314 0.1961 rg 1 0 0 1 48.000 153.800 Tm (PostgreSQL/RPC. Supabase avoids a separately operated application server. Use an OS-backed secure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.000 Tf 0.0902 0.2314 0.1961 rg 1 0 0 1 48.000 139.300 Tm (storage adapter for Auth session persistence rather than assuming the SDK's default persistence is) Tj ET
